{"id":"n861db0b129","headline":"Zhu Rongji, Chinese premier who overhauled economy, dies at 98","summary":"Zhu Rongji, who pushed through reforms at state-owned companies and helped engineer China's entry into the World Trade Organization, has died at 98. Reforms under his premiership cost tens of millions of workers their jobs.","why":"Zhu led China's economic policy in the late 1990s, a period that reshaped state enterprises and opened the economy to global trade. His legacy remains central to how investors assess China's reform history.","category":"economy","event_type":"other","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Beijing","country":"China","lat":39.904,"lon":116.407,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Star","url":"https://www.thestar.com.my/aseanplus/aseanplus-news/2026/08/12/zhu-rongji-chinese-premier-who-overhauled-economy-dies-at-98"},"sources":[{"name":"The Star","url":"https://www.thestar.com.my/aseanplus/aseanplus-news/2026/08/12/zhu-rongji-chinese-premier-who-overhauled-economy-dies-at-98"}],"published_at":"2026-08-12T19:06:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T00:21:16Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"cc2c97c58fd95e50","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T00:21:16Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-12T19:06:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-12T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"CH","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/parliament-government-building-2463230.jpg","alt":"parliament government building (illustration)","credit":"Felix-Mittermeier","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/federal-council-politics-2463230/"}}